 "caveats": [
  "four subjects, one site 3 session each: means and per-subject signs, no intervals; the cross-vendor map is fitted on 3 subjects",
  "vendor differs in more than the vendor: TE 95 against 90 ms, TR (pixdim) 6.35 against 5.9 s, 50 against 48 slices, two forward b0s (first) against one (last), stated b per direction 1980-2005 against 2000, uint16 against scaled int16, other gradient hardware, coil and reconstruction; the site 3 session is another day as well as another scanner",
  "the readout time is nominal on both (no sidecars): the field is estimated and applied with the same value, so the correction is consistent within a scan but the Hz scale is not comparable across vendors",
  "the site 3 rescan is resampled once onto A's grid (cubic), as the same-scanner rescan is",
  "the same people on both scanners: the cross-vendor LOSO map never sees the target person; the same-scanner map applied cross vendor is fitted without the target person too"
 ]
